\) sunny lines.\n\nSince we have exhibited a feasible configuration for every integer \\(k\\) with \\(0\\le k\\le n\\) and the obvious bound \\(k\\le n\\) holds, the admissible values of \\(k\\) are exactly  \n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\{0,1,2,\\dots ,n\\}} .\n\\]"

